e=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726630/extras/47b6d7c94d5091661f4a769a23bbd768.mp4?t=1769840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS FROM REAL LIFE &amp; KNOWN FRANCHISES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a bunch of cool characters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rodney Douglas Norman - A Comedian with his heart in the right place and a guide of life</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salad Fingers - A Cartoon Character from David Firth in a post-apocalyptic setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jon Lloyd - A Metal Guru, transformed into a slug in game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hawkon Langlete - Another Metal Messiah</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baron Von Butcher - A Goat-riding Dark Lord from the Underworld</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND MORE!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Voiceacting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726630/extras/fd78dcaf81823b8baa5633b9696229ca.poster.avif?t=1769840837\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726630/extras/fd78dcaf81823b8baa5633b9696229ca.webm?t=1769840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726630/extras/fd78dcaf81823b8baa5633b9696229ca.mp4?t=1769840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT A LOT OF STUFF!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Songs from real Indie musicians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Butterflies &amp; More</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Outfits &amp; Looks for Slaug the slug</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool Items &amp; Weapons to find</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE ON JOBS!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plumber - Chimney Sweeper - Postman - Carpenter - Farmer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean Toilets, Sweep Chimneys, Deliver Letters, Build Structures, Grow Stuff</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BIG ADVENTURE GAME LIKE NOTHING ELSE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726630/extras/054b5333be29cc28f8da295b40173af5.avif?t=1769840837\" width=1062 height=670 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726630/extras/a292eaa43ff820d7399a912164bab1a7.poster.avif?t=1769840837\" width=46 height=55 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726630/extras/a292eaa43ff820d7399a912164bab1a7.webm?t=1769840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Insanity 1 is a delirious fantasy made up in Slaug's head when being knocked out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Insanity 2 is just a side story in the same franchise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depths of Insanity 3 is the Origin Story where everything starts after waking up from a knockout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726630/extras/fa78c80e3a3c1c75427b023109983afa.avif?t=1769840837\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_im